{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Progress (lane 04f1, worktree epic-04f1-facade at b1228deb72f). Implemented as planned:\n- `src/rebar/_mcp_derive.py` (factory + hooks, ~370 LOC) and `src/rebar/_mcp_tool_specs.py` (48 specs, ~735 LOC; descriptions generated from the golden and asserted byte-equal; divergence reasons carried from the deleted manifest).\n- Golden captured from b1228deb72f before any derivation code; `test_mcp_tool_surface_golden.py` (68 tests) passed on the first derived run.\n- `_mcp_reads.py` / `_mcp_writes.py` now hold only the MCP-only tools: `grep -c @mcp.tool` = 8 and 1.\n- Decisions: (1) signatures are derived from the facade function as DEFINED in its `rebar._lib_*` module, not `getattr(rebar, name)`, because tests patch `rebar.link` / `rebar.bridge_*` before the server is built (a patched lambda would derive an empty signature); calls still go through `rebar.<name>` per call so patches are honoured. (2) `fsck` derives from `fsck_report` (the structured result the tool always returned). (3) The pydantic TypedDict rebuild for the set_* inputs moved into `_mcp_tool_specs`. (4) ADR is 0119 (0118 taken).\n- Two out-of-plan test edits (file impact widened): `tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp.py` (fallback test loads `_mcp_tool_specs`) and `tests/unit/test_secret_screen_e7a9.py` (its `inspect.getsource(_mcp_writes)` scan for `rebar.comment(ticket_id, body)` becomes an assertion on the derived signature: params exactly `[ticket_id, body]`, `allow_secret_pattern` in `strip`).\n- The named behavioural suites are unmodified (git diff --stat empty). lint, typecheck, gen_mcp_reference --check (docs/mcp-reference.md unchanged), check_adr_numbers, complexity (stale only), mechanism (--update-stale drops ci_gate::scripts/check_mcp_library_parity.py) green; 251 MCP/schema test modules green. make verify running."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792405016708623001,"uuid":"c2b0a284-9fc5-40b3-88de-d2f4cec26599"}